  "notes": "Removing material from a workpiece with a cutting tool to shape it. Covers turning, milling, drilling, and similar processes.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {切削|せっさく}⟦{加工|かこう}→加工：11793_kakou⟧: machining; cutting work\n- {切削|せっさく}⟦{工具|こうぐ}→工具：01401_kougu⟧: a cutting tool\n- {切削|せっさく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to machine; to cut\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{旋削|せんさく}→旋削：29605_sensaku⟧: turning — cutting on a lathe, one type of {切削|せっさく}",
